istant", "tool_use": {"name": "mcp__onedata__get_transfer", "input": {"transfer_id": "331c4142c8df03de3cfd0d1226affa0ach8568"}}}, {"role": "assistant", "text": "The transfer is currently scheduled. Let me verify the file distribution to confirm the replication is complete:"}, {"role": "assistant", "tool_use": {"name": "mcp__onedata__get_file_distribution", "input": {"file_id_or_path": "/icsoc_sweep_rq2-ss2-gated-20260706_5b52f083/harness/inc2b/trial-031a95929728.bin"}}}, {"role": "assistant", "text": "I can see the replication is in progress. The file is currently at 'cloud-pl' with the full 4096 bytes, and the transfer to 'de' has been scheduled. The 'de' site shows the file is queued but the bytes haven't started copying yet. Let me check the transfer status once more:"}, {"role": "assistant", "tool_use": {"name": "mcp__onedata__get_transfer", "input": {"transfer_id": "331c4142c8df03de3cfd0d1226affa0ach8568"}}}, {"role": "assistant", "text": "Good progress\u2014the transfer moved to \"enqueued\" status and started (startTime is set). For a small 4KB file, this should complete very quickly. Let me verify the current distribution to confirm both replicas are now in place:"}, {"role": "assistant", "tool_use": {"name": "mcp__onedata__get_file_distribution", "input": {"file_id_or_path": "/icsoc_sweep_rq2-ss2-gated-20260706_5b52f083/harness/inc2b/trial-031a95929728.bin"}}}, {"role": "assistant", "text": "The transfer is in progress but the bytes haven't appeared at 'de' yet. Let me check the transfer status to see if it's completed:"}, {"role": "assistant", "tool_use": {"name": "mcp__onedata__get_transfer", "input": {"transfer_id": "331c4142c8df03de3cfd0d1226affa0ach8568"}}}, {"role": "assistant", "text": "I can now report the status:\n\n**Current guarantee:** The file is durably available at **cloud-pl** (full 4096 bytes stored). Replication to the 'de' site has been scheduled (transfer ID: 331c4142c8df03de3cfd0d1226affa0ach8568) and is now **enqueued** in the transfer